{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"revenueCatPaywallAndCustomerCenter","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"state","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:13SwiduxPaywall0B5StateV","text":"PaywallState","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"offeringIdentifier","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"? = nil, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"displayCloseButton","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" = true, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"fonts","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": any ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12RevenueCatUI19PaywallFontProviderP","text":"PaywallFontProvider","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" = DefaultPaywallFontProvider(), ","kind":"text"},{"text":"presentationStyle","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:25SwiduxRevenueCatPaywallUI0bcD17PresentationStyleO","text":"RevenueCatPaywallPresentationStyle","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywallUI\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywallUI\/RevenueCatPaywallPresentationStyle","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" = .automatic, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"purchaseLogic","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:25SwiduxRevenueCatPaywallUI0bcD13PurchaseLogicV","text":"RevenueCatPaywallPurchaseLogic","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywallUI\/documentation\/SwiduxRevenueCatPaywallUI\/RevenueCatPaywallPurchaseLogic","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"? = nil, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"onEvent","kind":